Incorporated code
-----------------

- toolkit owns a small input adapter derived from iced at
  `3de451447bd28217bb535632867550908e29d5d0`, MIT,
  Copyright 2019 Héctor Ramón and Iced contributors:
  `libs/toolkit/src/text_field/{input,raw}.rs` from
  `core/src/text/input.rs` and `widget/src/text_input.rs`.
  The MIT notice is retained in each file; the renderer's public editor
  engine remains upstream code. No private input-state accessor is required.

- compd (services/compd) incorporates code from y5 / Nourish,
  https://github.com/y5-snowies/nourish, Copyright (c) 2026 Yarden Apelker,
  licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 and redistributed under the same terms. Its
  copyright line is carried in LICENSE-MIT.
- toolkit (libs/toolkit) incorporates code from iced_drop,
  https://github.com/jhannyj/iced_drop, Copyright (c) 2024 Jonathan
  Hanney Jimenez, licensed MIT (crate tarball; the repo Cargo.toml
  lacks the field): `dnd::find_zones` in `src/dnd.rs` from
  `src/widget/operation/drop.rs` at commit `3036537`.
- toolkit (libs/toolkit) incorporates code from iced-color-picker,
  https://github.com/B0ney/iced-color-picker, Copyright (c) 2025 B0ney,
  licensed MIT: `src/color_picker.rs` (Hsv conversions, Spectrum
  drawing, the ColorPicker widget and its marker) adapted from
  `src/widget.rs` and `src/widget/{hsv,spectrums,style}.rs` at commit
  `2f84daa`. Won the census bake-off against iced_aw's color_picker:
  already on 0.15-dev, a quarter of the size, no chrono.
- toolkit (libs/toolkit) incorporates code from A-Disruption/widgets,
  https://github.com/A-Disruption/widgets (MIT, LICENSE.txt in repo),
  Copyright (c) 2025 A-Disruption: `src/anchor.rs` is the placement core
  (`src/anchor.rs`, placement math and safe-corridor tests) at commit
  `9c6bbdf` ported whole; `src/popover.rs` re-expresses their popover on
  that placement core without the animation layer.
- toolkit (libs/toolkit) incorporates code from iced_palette,
  https://github.com/tuco86/iced_palette, Copyright (c) 2025 Its-Just-Nia
  and contributors, licensed MIT: `src/command_palette.rs` (Command,
  Sublime-style `fuzzy_match`, filter/rank, selection helpers and the
  palette view) adapted from `src/{command,search,helpers}.rs` at commit
  `dd70e2b`.
- toolkit (libs/toolkit) incorporates code from iced_table,
  https://github.com/tarkah/iced_table, Copyright (c) 2024 Tom Dohrmann,
  licensed MIT: `src/table.rs` (table, Column trait, scroll-synced
  header/footer, resize Divider) adapted from `src/{lib,divider}.rs` at
  commit `b59fd2c`. The catalog was reshaped to a lazy band token
  resolved at draw time.
- toolkit (libs/toolkit) incorporates code from iced_split,
  https://github.com/edwloef/iced_split, Copyright (c) 2025 Edwin Löf,
  licensed MIT: `src/split.rs` re-expresses `src/lib.rs` at commit
  `1a19c1e` on this iced base (no Fluid/Bounded Length, no animation);
  the API shape (Direction, Strategy, drag/double-click callbacks) is
  iced_split's.
- toolkit (libs/toolkit) incorporates code from iced_aw,
  https://github.com/iced-rs/iced_aw, Copyright (c) 2025 the iced_aw
  contributors (Kaiden42, Andrew Wheeler, Redhawk18), licensed MIT:
  `src/{badge,card,drop_down,flush_column,labeled_frame,number_input,
  selection_list,selection_list/list,sidebar,slide_bar,spinner,tab_bar,
  tab_bar/tab_label,tabs,typed_input,wrap}.rs` adapted from
  `src/widget/*` at commit `f80f659` (master, 2026-10-05). The close and
  modifier glyphs are text (`×`, `▲`, `▼`); iced_aw's iced_fonts glyphs
  (whose upstream repo is deleted) are not used. iced_aw's
  `SidebarWithContent` was not taken (the plain `Sidebar` is the census
  item; `tabs::Tabs` is the owning variant).
- toolkit (libs/toolkit) incorporates code from sweeten,
  https://github.com/airstrike/sweeten, Copyright (c) 2026 Andy Terra,
  licensed MIT: `src/fit_text.rs` (the `FitText` widget, adapted) and
  `src/focus.rs` (the `:focus-visible` ring) from
  `src/widget/{fit_text,focus}.rs` at commit `83db68f` (master). The
  custom-widget and quad-styling templates in `libs/toolkit/CONTRIBUTING.md`
  are adapted from iced's MIT-licensed `examples/custom_widget` and
  `examples/custom_quad` (vendor/iced).
- toolkit absorbs code from the author's own MIT OR Apache-2.0 cosmix
  workspace (https://github.com/markc/cosmix), rewritten generic on entry:
  `src/elide.rs` and `src/tips.rs` from dopus
  (`apps/dopus/src/view/{elide,tips}.rs`, `7aeeb68`), `src/timers.rs` from
  ced (`apps/ced/src/chrome/timer.rs`, `248c928`), `src/ime.rs` from term
  (`apps/term/src/ime.rs`, `cae5196`), `src/requester.rs` from ced
  (`apps/ced/src/chrome/dialogs/file.rs`) and `src/dnd.rs` in part from
  dopus (`apps/dopus/src/view/drag.rs`), and `src/measure.rs` /
  `src/images.rs` from this repository's scene-host
  (`services/compd/crates/scene-host/src/{layout,images}.rs`).
  `src/shell.rs` composes the toolbar, places and status patterns from
  dopus (`apps/dopus/src/view/{toolbar,places}.rs`) and ced
  (`apps/ced/src/chrome/status.rs`) using the existing generic widgets.

